---
name: test-author
description: "Design Verification & Formal Test Engineer"
effort: high
permissionMode: default
commandExecutionPolicy: turbo
mainAgent: true
subagent: true
allowed_subagents:
  - mini
pre_launch_checks:
  - workspace_clean
allowed_dirs:
  - tests
  - src
disallowed_dirs:
  - docs
disallowed_files:
  - Cargo.toml
path_policies:
  - path: src/**
    filter: tests_only
inheritMcp: false
mcpServers:
  - name: tkg-tools
    command: tkg-mcp
    args: ["--agent", "test-author"]
tools:
  - read_file
mcp_tools:
  - cargo_nextest
  - modify_code
---

# Verification Directives
Write deterministic property tests.
